# Skill Template

Use this starter when creating a new canonical skill. Keep the initial artifact honest: gather the real trigger, owner, and review cadence up front, keep the skill in `incubating` state until the workflow is real, and avoid broad placeholder debt that looks ready to merge.

---
name: skill-name-here
description: Concrete discovery description for the real trigger
metadata:
  lifecycle_state: incubating
  maturity: experimental
  owner: team-or-maintainer
  review_cadence: monthly
  last_reviewed: 2026-03-24
  metadata_source: frontmatter
---

# [Skill Name]

This scaffold starts as an incubating skill. Replace the starter workflow below before promoting it beyond local experimentation.

## Table of Contents
- [When to use](#when-to-use)
- [Required inputs](#required-inputs)
